{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotent", "label": "idempotent (Middleware)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Enforces at-most-once write processing via a client-supplied header; the handler runs only on the first request and later ones replay the stored response, so a network retry cannot double-charge.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotency_options", "label": "IdempotencyOptions", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "keyPrefix namespaces the cache so several wrappers share one Redis; a returned error response is cached unconditionally so a failed payment does not become a successful one, while a throwing handler releases its in-flight claim.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_request_fingerprint", "label": "SHA-256-Request-Fingerprint", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Stops a client reusing one key for a semantically different request (422 on mismatch); the query enters canonically \u2014 keys sorted so a reordered retry still replays, values of a repeated key keeping their order because some APIs read such a list positionally.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_key_validation", "label": "Validierung des Idempotency-Keys", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The attacker-chosen header value lands verbatim in a cache key, so length and control characters/spaces are rejected with 400 \u2014 CR/LF are the header-injection pair and spaces plus control bytes are command separators in memcached's text protocol; the rejection names the bound and index, never the key, because echoing attacker bytes is how an error message becomes a payload.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_inflight_conflict", "label": "In-Flight-Behandlung (409)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "A concurrent second request is rejected fast instead of queued, so no cross-pod lock is needed \u2014 the in-flight marker lives in the same cache as the stored responses.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_identity_scope", "label": "identity (Scope pro Aufrufer)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Folded into the cache key so an identity-specific cached response is never served to a different caller; without it two callers sharing key, method, path, query and body share a response (security audit HTTP-4).", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_cache_isolation_hazard", "label": "Cache niemals mit rateLimit oder cached teilen", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "InMemoryCache is LRU-bounded with eviction blind to what an entry protects, so a key flood pushes stored responses out and an honest retry re-runs the handler; setIfAbsent does not mark a record as recently used, so a claimed key ages toward eviction from the moment it is stored.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_redis_multi_pod", "label": "Redis-Backing f\u00fcr Multi-Pod", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Every pod sees the same idempotency state; with a per-pod InMemoryCache a retry landing on another pod processes again.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotent", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotency_options", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_request_fingerprint", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_key_validation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotency_options", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_inflight_conflict", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_identity_scope", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_request_fingerprint", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_cache_isolation_hazard", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotency_options", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_redis_multi_pod", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_cache_isolation_hazard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_key_validation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_error_handling_generic_500_redaction", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_request_fingerprint", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_csrf_hmac_token", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_cache_isolation_hazard", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_mailboxes_unbounded_fifo_default", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_inflight_conflict", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_mailboxes_mailboxfullerror", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_idempotency_key_identity_scope", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_logging_logcontext_runeach", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/idempotency-key.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}